          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: die Hitzewelle",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "die Hitzewelle — \"the heatwave\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Während der Hitzewelle sind die Schwimmbäder voll. During the heatwave the swimming pools are full."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: die Hitzewellen."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Hitzewelle is built from Hitze 'heat', an inherited word related to heiß 'hot', and Welle 'wave', also an inherited Germanic word (EtymDB lists Welle)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
