              "text": "die Dürre — \"the drought\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Nach der langen Dürre ist das Gras braun. After the long drought the grass is brown."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: die Dürren. Dürr — very dry; thin."
            }
          ]
        },
